{"overview":"ملکه پوپی و برنچ با دیدن دنیای متفاوت ترول‌های دیگر و نوع زندگی آن ها بسیار شگف زده می‌شوند. زمانی که یک خطر بزرگ دنیای همه ترول‌ها را تهدید می‌کند، پوپی و برنچ و دوستان آن‌ها دوباره آماده جنگیدن می‌شوند. اما این بار بین ترول‌ها ترس و اضطراب زیادی وجود دارد. حالا پوپی و برنچ هستند که باید تصمیم بگیرند که چطور به ترول‌ها کمک کنند...","tagline":"","overview_en":"Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.","tagline_en":"Happiest. Movie. Ever.","runtime":91,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["والت دورن"],"crew_en":["Walt Dohrn"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"آنا کندریک","role":"Poppy (voice)","photo":"/i2HIJQcBsUQ3o9HwEeDwou45D60.jpg","en":"Anna Kendrick"},{"name":"جاستین تیمبرلیک","role":"Branch (voice)","photo":"/6Yk5t9RwkdkAT8Qv45934Eez2CA.jpg","en":"Justin Timberlake"},{"name":"Ron Funches","role":"Cooper (voice)","photo":"/DtULMxPvAlOKfrwISxdEffIKlk.jpg"},{"name":"ریچل بلوم","role":"Barb (voice)","photo":"/hfnU70X7QOdiURFEd1hM7gQIe6J.jpg","en":"Rachel Bloom"},{"name":"جیمز کوردن","role":"Biggie (voice)","photo":"/xGB0gfZ48M27gQjjL7inJIh1Pqj.jpg","en":"James Corden"},{"name":"Kelly Clarkson","role":"Delta Dawn (voice)","photo":"/mfqjGz99cMbZLLg1eHwU2OUsOjK.jpg"},{"name":"اندرسون پاک","role":"Prince D (voice)","photo":"/fhoNMocbdaGwuVdDOVJF2rQxNwZ.jpg","en":"Anderson .Paak"},{"name":"سام راکول","role":"Hickory (voice)","photo":"/afYhNpLwpa65Yy0Q0g00FNFhzx5.jpg","en":"Sam Rockwell"},{"name":"George Clinton","role":"King Quincy (voice)","photo":"/wLRc7AUiuHS9e0nAXpXbWZO2h8O.jpg"},{"name":"Mary J. Blige","role":"Queen Essence (voice)","photo":"/riQBsxzhbp8E7T9noJEZrEoLZWO.jpg